* A product listing API is called repeatedly when navigating between pages. How would you avoid unnecessary network requests?
* Your dashboard needs data from five independent APIs. How would you load them efficiently and handle partial failures?
* One API depends on the result of another API. How would you sequence the requests using RxJS?
* A user clicks the Save button multiple times and creates duplicate records. How would you prevent duplicate submissions?
* An HTTP request continues after the user navigates away from a component. How would you manage its lifecycle?
* An API intermittently returns HTTP 503. How would you implement retries with an appropriate delay?
* A POST request times out, and you do not know whether the backend processed it. How would you prevent duplicate transactions?
* Your application must attach a correlation ID to every API request. How would you implement this?
* Different backend services require different authorization headers. How would you design the interceptor logic?
* Your application receives inconsistent error formats from multiple backend services. How would you normalize them?
