* The same API is called by multiple components at the same time. How would you share its result efficiently?
* A cached API response becomes outdated after an update operation. How would you invalidate the cache?
* An API returns HTTP 204 No Content, and your application incorrectly assumes a response body exists. How would you handle this?
* A request works locally but fails in production due to a different API base URL. How would you configure environment-specific endpoints?
